<title>NETHERLANDS: EVC to acquire Caprihans India.</title>
<headline>EVC to acquire Caprihans India.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>European PVC maker EVC International NV said on Monday it had agreed to aquire control of PVC film maker Caprihans India Limited.</p>
<p>Through its German subsidiary VKW, EVC is to aquire 51 percent of the enlarged share capital of Caprihans India Limited, EVC said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;For EVC, the acquisition represents the first step outside of Western Europe, in a large and fast growing market,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The acquisition cost less than three percent of EVC's net asset value.</p>
<p>Caprihans India posted 1996 sales of about 82 million guilders and had total assets of 97 million guilders.</p>
<p>EVC International is Europe's biggest PVC producer. Britain's ICI and Italy's Enichem jointly hold a minority stake.</p>
